{
  "showInFeed": true,
  "draft": false,
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-21",
  "body": "<figure data-social=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DevRDBPu-1U/\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DevRDBPu-1U/\">Instagram embed — https://www.instagram.com/p/DevRDBPu-1U/</a></figure>\n\n  \n\nThere have been a lot of great Lower East Side TwoWheelTuesdays this year, but the weather looked amazing for mid-October, so a bunch of Gotham DOC members decided to check out Le Lotus Bleú Cafe on Allen Street.\n\nPiers and Robert were out on their twin black SportClassics.\n\n<figure><img src=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/da3ed548-be49-42ce-8793-c1ec6359a276-72c0c85b5cf5c43c40961d59615d28d2df2257984a6fbedebcc1ce73360b9587.webp\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\nAlbert and Walter were also down on their twin TriColore V4s's twinning in full red, white and green regalia.\n\n<figure><img src=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/img-9807-87643b10c28bb688932cee3b7f560f73d0513389ce140908a164f6a6276b35e2.webp\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\nIt was a beautiful evening and great to hang out with the Gotham crew and meet some new two wheeled New Yorkers! \\]\n\n<img src=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/img-9809-reading-ead4080a3e7479de7bd4e63c94fb929a72dcd183e02cd15b8cef0bb478506f28.webp\" data-full=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/img-9809-large-685ca36456bc820024f27323de0d68366e7e1b1b0c330b75154a9eb813648409.webp\" data-thumb=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/img-9809-thumb-db57c1796d0f562158d88495473b48a3f5b9b325618774080bb68b7c41f9e4ee.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\">\n\nGreat to see everyone out and about downtown! \n\n<img src=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/img-9801-reading-3414507690c88a89ed13788da21dbdf2cc15d222545525a8e2e3e880fe6107a0.webp\" data-full=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/img-9801-large-978b39c8087a834ab85b9ef7a8ae5afeb52bf04c8ab5dfbf2cce2110cc4060ce.webp\" data-thumb=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/img-9801-thumb-72ce57b558cc12dab1c0b3c193bf619aed90226afe4332c5cac35a1e8e5b5f37.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\">\n\nCan't wait for Dapper Ducs this Sunday!!\n\n<figure><img src=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/3309bc76-8ef4-430f-9783-38e3ec4d07f6-reading-b7c714d3d10efc6805cd7576020451b93beb1fecc3fd271d680003097a867a6f.webp\" data-full=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/3309bc76-8ef4-430f-9783-38e3ec4d07f6-large-c24ae60c4f8b916c99d06014f9f82a0d61ff3bb9c3ea81f6a9d49a61108a6d28.webp\" data-thumb=\"https://nyducati.hidden-silence-47e4.workers.dev/media/images/3309bc76-8ef4-430f-9783-38e3ec4d07f6-thumb-fe91f46cc4fbbe872b3ef5175114adcef9996f32370665236fc211f04d7ec5d5.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"960\"></figure>",
